To entangle two of the nuclear spins, we exploit the hyperfine interaction between the electron spin and each of the nuclear spins. Here, simply by enacting a 2π rotation of the electron spin conditional on the configuration of the nuclear spins, we implement a geometric CZ gate between the nuclear spins23,30. To illustrate this, starting with the control nuclear spin in state \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
